  "summary_of_core_decisions": "The text presents Nietzsche's genealogy as a critical method that avoids the genetic fallacy by shifting from logical refutation to existential illumination. It distinguishes traditional morality as life-denying from a future morality as life-enhancing, grounds evaluation in will to power and life-enhancement, and resolves the tension between historical explanation and critical force by showing that genealogy operates on presuppositions and lived effects rather than formal consistency.",
